>> title: Instant Pot Carnitas
>> servings: 8
>> author: Ted Lin
>> date: 2020-03-21
>> dish: carnitas
>> cuisine: Tex-Mex
>> course: main
>> keywords: pork, instant pot, tacos
>> summary: House-style carnitas, tex-mex meets asia; about 15 min of work and 25 min of waiting.
